{"id":8785,"date":"2024-06-12T18:43:59","date_gmt":"2024-06-12T18:43:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=8785"},"modified":"2026-05-27T10:16:05","modified_gmt":"2026-05-27T10:16:05","slug":"how-to-find-a-great-deal-on-a-house-to-remodel","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/how-to-find-a-great-deal-on-a-house-to-remodel\/","title":{"rendered":"How To Find A Great Deal On A House To Remodel?\u00a0"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Looking to find a great deal on a house to renovate? We&#8217;ve got you covered! Here are some tips and tricks to help you discover the perfect property for your next renovation project.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Finding a home that needs renovation can be challenging, especially when you&#8217;re targeting a specific area. However, with the right approach, you can narrow down your search and find the ideal place. Once you&#8217;ve secured the property, you&#8217;ll need a <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/\" title=\"\">reliable company<\/a> to handle the renovation. Read on to learn how to find a good house for renovation and set the stage for a successful project with the help of professional expertise.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/female-real-estate-agent-shows-blueprint-of-house-2023-11-27-05-08-12-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"A lady discussing the remodeling plan with a consultant\" class=\"wp-image-8789\" style=\"width:840px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Find an Investor-Friendly Realtor<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you&#8217;re planning on buying a home with the intent to renovate and potentially sell, working with a real estate agent who understands your needs is crucial. Not all realtors are created equal, and an investor-friendly realtor can make a world of difference.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why You Need an Investor-Friendly Realtor<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Expertise in Investment Properties<\/strong>: They understand what makes a property a good investment and can spot potential deals quickly.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Network of Contacts<\/strong>: They often have connections with contractors, inspectors, and other professionals who can help you assess the property and plan renovations.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Efficiency<\/strong>: Investor-friendly realtors won\u2019t waste your time showing properties that don\u2019t meet your criteria. They know you\u2019re looking for a deal and will help you find it.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For instance, in areas like Felida, WA, and Tigard, OR, where the real estate market can be competitive, having a realtor who knows how to find undervalued properties can be a game-changer.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Finding the Right Realtor<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Look for real estate agents who specialize in investment properties or have significant experience working with investors. You can start by asking for recommendations from other investors or searching online for top-rated agents in your desired area. Check their reviews and ask for references to ensure they have a proven track record of success.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Find Houses That Need a Lot of Repairs<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When searching for a house to remodel, look for properties that need significant repairs. These homes often have less competition and more room for negotiation, which can lead to better deals.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Buying a Fixer-Upper<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Lower Purchase Price<\/strong>: Homes needing major repairs are often sold at a discount.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Customization<\/strong>: You have the opportunity to design and renovate the home exactly to your liking.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Potential for Profit<\/strong>: Well-executed renovations can significantly increase the home&#8217;s value, leading to a profitable sale.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where to Look<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Check online real estate listings, foreclosure auctions, and distressed property sales. Websites like Zillow, Realtor.com, and local real estate agency websites often have filters to search for fixer-uppers. Additionally, driving around neighborhoods in places like Portland, OR, and Happy Valley, OR, might reveal properties with \u201cFor Sale\u201d signs that aren\u2019t listed online.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/the-process-grinding-a-wooden-parquet-floor-in-usi-2023-11-27-05-36-29-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"home remodeling expert\" class=\"wp-image-8791\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Don&#8217;t Buy the First Deal That Comes Along<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It&#8217;s easy to get excited and want to jump on the first seemingly good deal you find. However, patience is key when it comes to finding the perfect renovation project.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Avoiding Impulse Buys<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Thorough Research<\/strong>: Investigate multiple properties and compare them. Look into the neighborhood, the extent of repairs needed, and the potential resale value.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Evaluate True Costs<\/strong>: Calculate the total cost of the property, including purchase price, renovation costs, and unexpected expenses. Make sure the numbers make sense and that there\u2019s a margin for profit.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Get Professional Opinions<\/strong>: Have a contractor or home inspector evaluate the property to identify any hidden issues that could become costly surprises later.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In markets like Lake Oswego, OR, and Hillsboro, OR, where property values can vary widely, it\u2019s important to make sure you\u2019re getting the best deal possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Don&#8217;t Be Afraid to Negotiate<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Negotiation is a crucial skill in real estate, especially when buying a home that needs renovation. Many sellers are willing to negotiate on price, especially if the home has been on the market for a while or requires extensive repairs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tips for Effective Negotiation<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Do Your Homework<\/strong>: Know the market value of similar homes in the area and use this information to support your offer.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Be Prepared to Walk Away<\/strong>: Don\u2019t get emotionally attached to any one property. Be ready to walk away if the seller isn\u2019t willing to meet your price.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Highlight the Property\u2019s Condition<\/strong>: Use the necessary repairs as leverage to negotiate a lower price.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For example, if you\u2019re looking at a distressed property in Beaverton, OR, you can point out the cost of necessary repairs to justify a lower offer.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider Off-Market Properties<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While traditional listings on real estate websites are a great place to start, don\u2019t overlook the potential of off-market properties. These are homes that aren\u2019t publicly listed for sale but might still be available if you know where to look. Often, these properties can be found through networking, direct mail campaigns, or by working with a well-connected realtor.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Off-Market Properties<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Less Competition<\/strong>: Since these properties aren\u2019t widely advertised, you\u2019re less likely to face bidding wars, giving you a better chance of securing a great deal.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Potential for Better Deals<\/strong>: Sellers of off-market properties might be more motivated to sell quickly, leading to a more favorable purchase price.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Opportunity for Direct Negotiation<\/strong>: Without the pressure of multiple offers, you might find sellers more open to negotiation, allowing for a smoother transaction.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In areas like Ridgefield, WA, and Washougal, WA, off-market properties can sometimes offer the hidden gems you\u2019ve been searching for.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/house-restoration-work-a-two-workers-grinds-concr-2023-11-27-05-24-26-utc-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"Two men working on home remodeling site\" class=\"wp-image-8792\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Find Off-Market Properties<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Network with Local Investors<\/strong>: Attend local real estate meetups and networking events to connect with other investors who might know of potential off-market deals.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Direct Mail Campaigns<\/strong>: Send letters to homeowners in your target area expressing your interest in purchasing their property.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Work with a Realtor<\/strong>: Some realtors specialize in finding off-market deals. They can leverage their network and market knowledge to uncover properties that aren\u2019t publicly listed.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Finding a great deal on a house to remodel requires patience, strategic planning, and the right resources. Whether you&#8217;re exploring traditional listings or seeking out off-market properties, working with an investor-friendly realtor and leveraging modern tools can significantly enhance your ability to identify and secure the perfect renovation project.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Remember to be diligent in your research, avoid rushing into purchases, and always be prepared to negotiate. By following these guidelines, you can confidently navigate the real estate market in areas like Camas, WA, and Lake Oswego, OR, ultimately finding a property that offers both the potential for a stunning renovation and a lucrative return on investment. Once you&#8217;ve found that perfect property, consider partnering with <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a> to bring your renovation vision to life. Our expertise and commitment to quality ensure your project will be a resounding success. Happy hunting!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Looking to find a great deal on a house to renovate? We&#8217;ve got you covered! Here are some tips and tricks to help you discover the perfect property for your next renovation project. Finding a home that needs renovation can be challenging, especially when you&#8217;re targeting a specific area. However, with the right approach, you [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":8788,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[33],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-8785","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-remodeling-tips"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8785","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8785"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8785\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":16332,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8785\/revisions\/16332"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8785"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=8785"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=8785"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}